## Slide 6: Security, Privacy & Human-in-the-Loop Governance
- **Zero-Data-Retention:** Contractual enforcement that client data is never used for foundation model training.
- **Mandatory Human-in-the-Loop:** All client-facing deliverables and drafts require explicit staff sign-off.
- **Granular Access Control:** Scoped API secrets stored in an enterprise secrets vault.

